<title>ARGENTINA: SOCCER-ARGENTINE CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ARGENTINE CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of weekend matches</p>
<p>in the Argentine Apertura championship:</p>
<p> Colon			 1   Platense		     1</p>
<p> Estudiantes		 0   Rosario Central	    2</p>
<p> Huracan-Corrientes	1   Huracan			1</p>
<p> Lanus			 3   Boca Juniors		 1</p>
<p> Newell's Old Boys	 1   Gimnasia-La Plata	  0</p>
<p> Racing Club		 0   Gimnasia-Jujuy	     0</p>
<p> River Plate		 2   Banfield		     0</p>
<p> San Lorenzo		 0   Deportivo Espanol	  1</p>
<p> Velez Sarsfield	   2   Independiente		3</p>
<p>Playing Monday: Ferro Carril Oeste v  Union</p>
<p>Standings (tabulate under - played, won, drawn, lost, goals</p>
<p>for, against, points):</p>
<p> Independiente	     3  3  0  0 10  2  9</p>
<p> River Plate		 3  2  1  0  5  1  7</p>
<p> Rosario Central	   3  2  1  0  4  0  7</p>
<p> Lanus			 3  2  1  0  4  1  7</p>
<p> Colon			 3  1  2  0  5  4  5</p>
<p> Gimnasia-Jujuy	    3  1  2  0  1  0  5</p>
<p> Deportivo Espanol	 3  1  1  1  2  2  4</p>
<p> Gimnasia-La Plata	 3  1  1  1  1  1  4</p>
<p> Racing Club		 3  1  1  1  3  4  4</p>
<p> Banfield		    3  1  1  1  2  3  4</p>
<p> Union			 2  1  0  1  7  6  3</p>
<p> Velez Sarsfield	   3  1  0  2  6  6  3</p>
<p> Huracan		     3  0  3  0  2  2  3</p>
<p> Estudiantes		 3  1  0  2  6  7  3</p>
<p> Boca Juniors		3  1  0  2  6  8  3</p>
<p> Newell's Old Boys	 3  1  0  2  1  6  3</p>
<p> Huracan-Corrientes	3  0  2  1  5  8  2</p>
<p> San Lorenzo		 3  0  1  2  1  3  1</p>
<p> Platense		    3  0  1  2  3  6  1</p>
<p> Ferro Carril Oeste	2  0  0  2  0  4  0</p>
<p>Note: the Apertura championship is the first of two</p>
<p>tournaments played in the Argentine season which runs from</p>
<p>August to July. The teams play each other once in each</p>
<p>competition and there is no overall champion.</p>
</text>
